      {"kind": "text", "slot": "summary", "rect": [226, 184, 329.28, 86], "style": "CV Body", "sample": "Reporter and editor with eleven years in regional and national newsrooms. I find the story inside messy public data, explain it clearly and build small teams that do the same. Most at home where spreadsheets meet shoe-leather reporting."},
