      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature1.body", "rect": [226, 356, 329.28, 60], "style": "CV Body", "sample": "Lead a team of four on investigations built from public records. Our series on hospital waiting times won a regional press award and changed how two health boards report their figures."},
